snp2.11:1.3 | S: Do you honor he who holds aloft | T: Is the one who holds up the torch for human beings honored by you?”
snp2.11:1.4 | S: the torch for all humanity?” | T: (none)
snp2.11:2.1 | S: “Familiarity breeds no contempt | T: “From living with him often
snp2.11:2.2 | S: for the man of wisdom. | T: I don’t despise the wise man.
snp2.11:2.3 | S: I always honor he who holds aloft | T: The one who holds up the torch for human beings is honored by me.”
snp2.11:2.4 | S: the torch for all humanity.” | T: (none)
